<title>THAILAND: Bank of Thailand seen cutting discount rate-paper.</title>
<headline>Bank of Thailand seen cutting discount rate-paper.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand is expected to announce a one percentage point reduction in its discount rate on Wednesday, the Business Day reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The newspaper quoted unnamed sources close to the finance minister as saying that the cut was aimed at pulling down the commercial bank lending rate. A finance ministry official declined to confirm or deny the report.</p>
